WIRE.md §3.2: keys equal after decoding repeat ("a" and "\u0061"); each repeat is one E7104
with its RFC 6901 pointer, and equal keys of different objects are not repeats.
-- data/rows.json --
{
  "a": {"a": 1},
  "\u0061": 2,
  "rows/all": [
    {"x": 1, "x": 2, "x": 3}
  ]
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E7104]  data/rows.json:3:3
  duplicate key "a" (first at data/rows.json:2)

error[E7104]  data/rows.json:5:14
  duplicate key "x" (first at data/rows.json:5)

error[E7104]  data/rows.json:5:22
  duplicate key "x" (first at data/rows.json:5)

3 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
